sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console
  participant API as FastAPI auth routes
  participant Auth as Auth module
  participant DB as Database
  Op->>UI: Enter username and password
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>DB: Find operator by username
  DB-->>API: Operator record
  API->>Auth: verify_password(password, salt, hash)
  alt Valid and account active
    Auth-->>API: Match
    API->>Auth: issue_token(username)
    Auth-->>API: HMAC-signed token with expiry
    API-->>UI: 200 with token
    UI->>API: GET /api/auth/me with Bearer token
    API-->>UI: Operator profile
    UI-->>Op: Open the console
  else Wrong credentials or disabled
    API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
    UI-->>Op: Show error
  end
